ion & batch optimization and direct 2K/4K output."},{"apiLink":"/document-api/api/video/image-to-video","releaseLink":"/dev/model-release/native-4k-video","imageUrl":"https://s15-kling.klingai.com/kos/s101/nlav112918/kling-web-tob/images/dev-home/flagship/flagship-cover-video-4k.9666ba031270006b.png","videoUrl":"https://s15-kling.klingai.com/kos/s101/nlav112918/kling-web-tob/videos/dev-home/flagship/flagship-image-4k.071927e9a8023f08.mp4","title":"Kling Native 4K Video","subTitle":"Film-grade visual quality built for commercial production."},{"apiLink":"/document-api/api/video/motion-control","releaseLink":"/dev/model-release/motion-control","imageUrl":"https://s15-kling.klingai.com/kos/s101/nlav112918/kling-web-tob/images/dev-home/flagship/flagship-cover-motion-control.9c79201a8a71b085.png","videoUrl":"https://s15-kling.klingai.com/kos/s101/nlav112918/kling-web-tob/videos/dev-home/flagship/flagship-image-motion-control.d82c7da4b01d2623.mp4","title":"Kling Motion Control","subTitle":"Recreate complex movement and accurate facial expression based on advanced motion capture technology"}],"enterpriseSection":{"title":"Enterprise Services","cards":[{"title":"API Service","desc":"For Developers & Enterprises. Integrate leading image and video generation into your products and workflows through enterprise APIs—secure, scalable, and built for compliance.","link":"/document-api/guides/get-started/overview"},{"title":"Enterprise Plan","desc":"For Enterprise Teams. No API integration needed. Use Kling’s creative tools to scale content production with enterprise-ready procurement, asset management, and compliance support.","link":"/dev/enterprise-membership"}]},"productFeatures":{"title":"Product Features","videoSectionTitle":"Video Models","imageSectionTitle":"Image Models","productFeaturesList":[{"tab":"Video Generation API","list":[{"media":{"cover":"https://s15-kling.klingai.com/kos/s101/nlav112918/kling-web-tob/images/dev-home/video-modal/video-modal-cover-t2v.c3e6aa6167f3ca0a.png","src":"https://s15-kling.klingai.com/kos/s101/nlav112918/kling-web-tob/videos/dev-home/video-model/video-modal-t2v-en.a210e0a0f9056782.mp4","type":"video"},"title":"Text to Video","desc":"Transform simple prompts into cinematic, high-definition videos with coherent structure and production-quality visuals.","link":"/document-api/api/video/text-to-video"},{"media":{"cover":"https://s15-kling.klingai.com/kos/s101/nlav112918/kling-web-tob/images/dev-home/video-modal/video-modal-cover-i2v.35e56413e2822c19.png","src":"https://s15-kling.klingai.com/kos/s101/nlav112918/kling-web-tob/videos/dev-home/video-model/video-modal-i2v-en.567b0518faf1dace.mp4","type":"video"},"title":"Image to Video","desc":"Leverages static images as visual anchors to produce coherent and smooth dynamic video, keeping styles and elements consistent.","link":"/document-api/api/video/image-to-video"},{"media":{"cover":"https://s15-kling.klingai.com/kos/s101/nlav112918/kling-web-tob/images/dev-home/video-modal/video-modal-cover-refer.f4c3806715bdc407.png","src":"https://s15-kling.klingai.com/kos/s101/nlav112918/kling-web-tob/videos/dev-home/video-model/video-modal-refer-en.636b5f4631c2bb46.mp4","type":"video"},"title":"Video Omni","desc":"Built on a unified multimodal framework with native support for multi-image reference, element reference, and video reference.","link":"/document-api/api/video/reference-to-video"},{"media":{"cover":"https://s15-kling.klingai.com/kos/s101/nlav112918/kling-web-tob/images/dev-home/video-modal/video-modal-cover-motion-control.e9a79e0127f37265.png","src":"https://s15-kling.klingai.com/kos/s101/nlav112918/kling-web-tob/videos/dev-home/video-model/video-modal-motion-control-en.236f22d47c0a959b.mp4","type":"video"},"title":"Motion Control","desc":"Precisely capture character movement and facial expression to generate controllable, performance-driven videos.","link":"/document-api/api/video/motion-control"},{"media":{"cover":"https://s15-kling.klingai.com/kos/s101/nlav112918/kling-web-tob/images/dev-home/video-modal/video-modal-cover-agent.d95a72324afd1064.png","src":"https://s15-kling.klingai.com/kos/s101/nlav112918/kling-web-tob/videos/dev-home/video-model/video-modal-agent-en.ed698b39248fa9d5.mp4","type":"video"},"title":"Avatar","desc":"Upload character images, add voice input, and generate lifelike avatars with natural performance and lip sync.","link":"/document-api/api/video/avatar"},{"media":{"cover":"https://s15-kling.klingai.com/kos/s101/nlav112918/kling-web-tob/images/dev-home/video-modal/video-modal-cover-effect.a8d55c4fa866d03b.png","src":"https://s15-kling.klingai.com/kos/s101/nlav112918/kling-web-tob/videos/dev-home/video-model/effect-en.431ad496d131595e.mp4","type":"video"},"title":"Effects","desc":"Apply trending visual effects instantly to create high-quality creative videos with minimal effort.","link":"/document-api/api/effects/templates"}]},{"tab":"Image Generation API","list":[{"media":{"src":"https://v4-kling.kechuangai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/kling-website/page4-v3-1.mp4","type":"video"},"title":"Enhanced Cinematic Visuals","desc":"Built with a deep understanding of user intent and native control over cinematic elements such as composition, lighting, tone, shot transitions, and depth of field for narrative-driven visual storytelling.","link":"/document-api/api/image/image-generation"},{"media":{"src":"https://v4-kling.kechuangai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/kling-website/page4-v3-2.mp4","type":"video"},"title":"Native 2K / 4K Output","desc":"Generate in native 2K and 4K Ultra HD for sharper visuals and production-ready quality optimized for professional creative workflows.","link":"/document-api/api/image/image-generation"},{"media":{"src":"https://v4-kling.kechuangai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/kling-website/page4-v3-3.mp4","type":"video"},"title":"Multi-Image Generation & Batch Optimization","desc":"Generate storyboard image sequences with cinematic composition and enhanced visual storytelling. Batch optimization tools reduce repetitive workflows and help maintain consistency across large-scale visual systems.","link":"/document-api/api/image/image-generation"}]}]},"demoSectionTitle":"Client Cases","demos":[{"title":"Advertising & E-commerce","desc":"Transform product images and descriptions into marketing videos with AI. Supporting multi-element references and interaction demos, Kling adapts to fashion, beauty, and consumer electronics industries—helping brands scale content efficiently while empowering agencies and luxury brands to deliver premium campaigns faster.","leftLayout":"media","subItems":[{"title":"One-Click E-Commerce Videos","prompt":"Produce commercial product promo videos with outfit, scene, and prop replacement for high consistency","thumbnails":["https://p4-kling.klingai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/kling-web-tob/images/dev-home/demo/demo-2-1.2b9e2ba90a5d398d.png","https://p2-kling.klingai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/kling-web-tob/images/dev-home/demo/demo-2-2.eb1238900aa823ca.png"],"video":"https://v2-kling.kechuangai.com/mediacloud/user-growth-media-transcode/video/b0a13719e49d5c44-51b60338ff93a23020def6e477471eeb-ugstdh264high.mp4?x-kcdn-pid=112452&ss=vps"},{"title":"Product Showcase","prompt":"Creative scene storytelling with high-fidelity product reproduction","thumbnails":["https://p2-kling.klingai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/kling-web-tob/images/dev-home/demo/demo-2-3.f438834595ad7acb.png","https://p4-kling.klingai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/kling-web-tob/images/dev-home/demo/demo-2-4.6b7b062a82ab984d.png"],"video":"https://v4-kling.kechuangai.com/mediacloud/user-growth-media-transcode/video/0a19ae18a144107d-2857723284cfbe263859fabc4ec2d8d6-ugstdh264high.mp4?x-kcdn-pid=112452&ss=vps"},{"title":"Premium TVC","prompt":"Generate cinematic-quality ads with brand storytelling and coherent multi-shot narrative","thumbnails":["https://p2-kling.klingai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/kling-web-tob/images/dev-home/demo/demo-2-5.0a1a84bae8cace2c.png","https://p2-kling.klingai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/kling-web-tob/images/dev-home/demo/demo-2-6.3a661d611703d440.png"],"video":"https://v4-kling.kechuangai.com/mediacloud/user-growth-media-transcode/video/fcf284950e669892-74ab01d0eaaef51c75e7493113576004-ugstdh264high.mp4?x-kcdn-pid=112452&ss=vps"},{"title":"Game Ad Assets","prompt":"Realistic scene texture, rich lighting, smooth transitions, and stable character appearance","thumbnails":["https://p2-kling.klingai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/kling-web-tob/images/dev-home/demo/demo-2-8.96a18e70a6940615.png","https://s15-kling.klingai.com/kos/s101/nlav112918/kling-web-tob/images/dev-home/demo/demo-2-7.cf41ab9fe5b4a7ad.png"],"video":"https://v4-kling.kechuangai.com/mediacloud/user-growth-media-transcode/video/7ba0961d70460a25-0bfc60de1af9ae26ca4bb642ad2b2ba1-ugstdh264high.mp4?x-kcdn-pid=112452&ss=vps"}]},{"title":"Smart Devices","desc":"Power rich visual experiences across every screen. Kling brings image and video generation, avatar and multimodal interaction to smart devices—from vehicles and phones to TVs, computers, and wearables—enabling immersive content and intelligent interactions across every touchpoint.","leftLayout":"basic","subItems":[{"title":"Smart Cockpit","video":"https://s15-kling.klingai.com/kos/s101/nlav112918/kling-web-tob/videos/dev-home/demos/智能驾驶（英文）.15f73a37c8c1b81e.mp4"},{"title":"Mobile & Tablet","video":"https://s15-kling.klingai.com/kos/s101/nlav112918/kling-web-tob/videos/dev-home/demos/手机展示（英文）.240c6256efdb9193.mp4"},{"title":"TV & Computer","video":"https://s15-kling.klingai.com/kos/s101/nlav112918/kling-web-tob/videos/dev-home/demos/电脑展示（英文）.df805272660d748a.mp4"},{"title":"Smart Watch","video":"https://s15-kling.klingai.com/kos/s101/nlav112918/kling-web-tob/videos/dev-home/demos/手表内容(英文）.b7d495185e9237bd.mp4"}]},{"title":"Professional Creative Platform","desc":"Built for professional creative platforms, AIGC tools, and creator communities worldwide, Kling AI delivers powerful image and video generation capabilities. Supporting text, image, and multimodal references, it integrates seamlessly into native creative workflows, helping design teams and creators produce high-quality content faster and boost product competitiveness.","leftLayout":"basic","subItems":[{"title":"AIGC Creation Tools","video":"https://s15-kling.klingai.com/kos/s101/nlav112918/kling-web-tob/videos/dev-home/demos/创作平台（英文).7427c92e49fa36e8.mp4"},{"title":"Creator Communities","video":"https://s15-kling.klingai.com/kos/s101/nlav112918/kling-web-tob/videos/dev-home/demos/创作社区（英文）.9172a84c95d74c00.mp4"}]},{"title":"AI Agents","desc":"Powered by multimodal generation and intelligent task orchestration, Kling serves as a scalable video generation engine for design, marketing, animation, and episodic storytelling. It provides stable, ready-to-use video creation capabilities as the underlying engine for different types of intelligent agents.","leftLayout":"agent","subItems":[{"title":"General Creative Agents","video":"https://v2-kling.kechuangai.com/mediacloud/user-growth-media-transcode/video/ab9ac5b0fd7562a7-851d1e6c4f50af0cc6c65fd1215045b4-ugstdh264high.mp4?x-kcdn-pid=112452&ss=vps","featureCards":[{"variant":"input","label":"Input:","items":["One-liner Concept","Reference Style","Keywords","Storyboard Script"]},{"variant":"agent","label":"Agent Orchestration:","text":"Creative Understanding · Multimodal Generation · Iterative Refinement"}]},{"title":"Marketing Agents","video":"https://v4-kling.kechuangai.com/mediacloud/user-growth-media-transcode/video/c509435ee15589a4-e725dd95105bcd0b5b467977d1ab50af-ugstdh264high.mp4?x-kcdn-pid=112452&ss=vps","featureCards":[{"variant":"input","label":"Input:","items":["Product Images","Key Selling Points","Use Case Scenarios"]},{"variant":"agent","label":"Agent Orchestration:","text":"Scene Matching · Product Video Generation · Intelligent Synthesis"}]},{"title":"Short-drama/Webtoon Agents","video":"https://v2-kling.kechuangai.com/mediacloud/user-growth-media-transcode/video/e360cd0566c3bc25-3a0fbb468b97eabbfaf00b9ee54e363a-ugstdh264high.mp4?x-kcdn-pid=112452&ss=vps","featureCards":[{"variant":"input","label":"Input:","text":"Script Structure, Character Setup, Story Synopsis"},{"variant":"agent","label":"Agent Orchestration:","text":"Script-to-Storyboard Breakdown · Scene Video Generation · Multi-Episode Sequencing"}]}]},{"title":"Film & TV Production","desc":"With character consistency, precise camera control, and multi-scene generation, Kling empowers production teams to produce professional-grade videos across formats—from animated shorts and premium AI live-action series to films and TV dramas. By streamlining previs, VFX, and production workflows, Kling accelerates timelines and reduces creative development and visual design costs.","leftLayout":"media","subItems":[{"title":"Films","video":"https://v2-kling.kechuangai.com/mediacloud/user-growth-media-transcode/video/9a67865d04ab3362-10f2a9923a776a311319b2085f4bb438-ugorgh264high.mp4?x-kcdn-pid=112452&ss=vps"},{"title":"TV Series","video":"https://v4-kling.kechuangai.com/mediacloud/user-growth-media-transcode/video/be4b863a9660234f-5140c3f0a3bdac8daea43f5f15f1abcc-ugorgh264high.mp4?x-kcdn-pid=112452&ss=vps"},{"title":"AI Live-Action Drama","video":"https://v2-kling.kechuangai.com/mediacloud/user-growth-media-transcode/video/96cbf225c1608284-e1d2cc93efb22503b72e24ebbcabebcd-ugorgh264high.mp4?x-kcdn-pid=112452&ss=vps"},{"title":"AI Anime Drama","video":"https://v2-kling.kechuangai.com/mediacloud/user-growth-media-transcode/video/780a8b4f76547aa4-b80cebc4811273b7d689b270fd74c9d0-ugorgh264high.mp4?x-kcdn-pid=112452&ss=vps"}]}]},"models":[{"name":"Video Generation","video":"https://v1-kling.kechuangai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/kling-website/dev-home/model-video-bg.cb39536e7c0db6b4.mp4","taskTypes":["Text to Video","Image to Video","Video Extension","Lip Sync","Video Effects","Elements Reference"]},{"name":"Image Generation","image":"https://p1-kling.klingai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/kling-website/dev-home/model-image-bg.b4d28687b1639508.png","taskTypes":["Text to Image","Image to Image"]},{"name":"Intelligent Scenarios","image":"https://p1-kling.klingai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/kling-website/dev-home/model-other-bg.b9d03458735fd5bf.png","taskTypes":["Virtual Try-on"]}],"modelUpgradeNotice":"The Kling 3.0 series models API is now fully available","subTitle":"Access the world’s most popular video and image generation models through secure, easy-to-use, and reliable API online service","demos":[{"title":"Professional Creation Platform","desc":"Expand AI video generation capabilities for professional creation scenarios, and support one-click conversion of text and static images to dynamic videos. Help designers and marketing teams quickly produce high-quality videos, improve the competitiveness of creation tools, and expand monetization scenarios.","video":"https://v1-kling.kechuangai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/kling-website/dev-home/demo-1-global.308958a99ecaeaf6.mp4"},{"title":"Entertainment and Social Applications","desc":"Provide an AI special effects generation engine to achieve creative gameplay such as old photo restoration, holiday theme special effects, and Dual-character Effects. Help entertainment apps and various social applications increase user interaction, improve user stickiness, and expand monetization paths.","video":"https://v1-kling.kechuangai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/kling-website/dev-home/demo-2-global.3d9f73e4e7668b72.mp4"},{"title":"E-commerce and Marketing Platform","desc":"Product display videos are automatically generated through product images and simple descriptions. Based on elements, characters and products can be interactively displayed, covering categories such as clothing, beauty, 3C, etc. Help merchants to produce high-quality marketing materials in batches, efficiently and at low cost.","video":"https://v1-kling.kechuangai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/kling-website/dev-home/demo-3-global.038434fdc4f93199.mp4"}],"demoMobileLogoUrl":"https://p1-kling.klingai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/kling-website/dev-home/dev-mobile-global-home-logo-1217.png","demoLogoUrl":"https://p1-kling.klingai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/dev-global-home-logo-250717.png","coopLogoUrl":"https://p1-kling.klingai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/kling-website/dev-home/coop-logo-en.dca2ee412bb2285b.png","apiVideoUrl":"https://v1-kling.kechuangai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/kling-website/dev-home/page3-video-en.37caf59c5ac36bc6.mp4","productFeatures":{"title":"Product Features","title1":"Product","title2":"Features","desc":"","productFeaturesList":[{"title":"Video Generation","titleTab":"Video Generation API","commentary":"Connect to the KLing Video LargeModel, seamlessly integrate text-to-video.image-to-video, lip sync, motion brush, AI effects, and other cutting-edge video generation capabilities.","list":[{"title":"Text to Video","media":{"prompt":"The camera passes through the coral cave from a first person perspective, at high speed","type":"video","src":"https://v1-kling.kechuangai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/kling-homepage-aio-prod_aio/assets/videos/model-video-1.6900686236fd8a15.mp4"}},{"title":"Image to Video","media":{"prompt":"The man slowly floated up with his eyes closed, and the camera followed him up slowly, his limbs naturally","referImageRight":"https://p1-kling.klingai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/kling-homepage-aio-prod_aio/assets/images/ttv.bf155b7345c70c00.png","type":"video","src":"https://v1-kling.kechuangai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/kling-homepage-aio-prod_aio/assets/videos/model-video-2.f136dcee53d42781.mp4"}},{"title":"Video Extension","media":{"type":"video","src":"https://v1-kling.kechuangai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/kling-homepage-aio-prod_aio/assets/videos/model-video-3.9dd689c609dc5e87.mp4"}},{"title":"Lip-Sync","media":{"audio":"10″Audio","type":"video","src":"https://v1-kling.kechuangai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/kling-homepage-aio-prod_aio/assets/videos/model-video-4.6a17a3c0bd109de9.mp4"}},{"title":"Video Effects","media":{"type":"video","audio":"5″Audio","src":"https://v1-kling.kechuangai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/kling-homepage-aio-prod_aio/assets/videos/model-video-5.259f7e695133e49c.mp4"}},{"title":"Multi-Image to Video","media":{"prompt":"The girl is wearing a sun hat and pink glasses","referImageLeftTop":"https://p1-kling.klingai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/kling-homepage-aio-prod_aio/assets/images/muti-1.7798f5d11eefe521.png","referImageLeftBottom":"https://p1-kling.klingai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/kling-homepage-aio-prod_aio/assets/images/muti-3.5d035a2024495b57.png","referImageRight":"https://p1-kling.klingai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/kling-homepage-aio-prod_aio/assets/images/muti-2.ac0be7c9bb4844f4.png","type":"video","src":"https://v1-kling.kechuangai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/kling-homepage-aio-prod_aio/assets/videos/model-video-6.bdfb682669810c7d.mp4"}},{"title":"Audio Generation","media":{"audio":"12″Audio","type":"video","src":"https://v1-kling.kechuangai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/audio-gen.76de01551dac28ff.mp4"}},{"title":"Multi-Elements","media":{"prompt":"","type":"video","src":"https://v1-kling.kechuangai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/multi-elements.ac20a642144e3060.mp4"}}]},{"title":"Image Generation","titleTab":"Image Generation API","commentary":"Enable rapid invocation of the Image Large Model, supporting text-to-image,image-to-image, and character referenceAPl integration.Experience premium image creation with one click","list":[{"title":"Text to Image","media":{"prompt":"The painting depicts an old-fashioned red Ford Mustang convertible driving in the desert, with blue sky and clouds overhead. The car was parked on very dry, cracked brown sand. Oil painting style with heavy brushstrokes.","type":"image","src":"https://p1-kling.klingai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/kling-homepage-aio-prod_aio/assets/images/ttp.cfaf051b99b47ac1.png"}},{"title":"Image to Image","media":{"prompt":"Black and white tones, black and white photography highlights the tension of light and shadow, oversized black suit coat, exaggerated wide shoulder design highlights the aura, collar naturally opens, hands naturally insert pockets, coat fabric presents a high-end texture, black straight hair, strong smoky eye makeup with matte lip makeup, sharp and deep eyes, gray gradient background","referImageRight":"https://p1-kling.klingai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/kling-homepage-aio-prod_aio/assets/images/ptp-1.8d5a061b6a20c9ed.png","type":"image","src":"https://p1-kling.klingai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/kling-homepage-aio-prod_aio/assets/images/ptp-2.1bb7b4c55f362b8c.png"}},{"title":"Multi-Image to Image","media":{"prompt":"","type":"image","src":"https://p1-kling.klingai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/multi-image-to-image.png"}},{"title":"Image Expansion","media":{"prompt":"","type":"image","src":"https://p1-kling.klingai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/image-expansion.png"}}]},{"title":"Virtual Try-On","titleTab":"Virtual Try-On API","commentary":"Ideal for virtual try-on scenes ine-commerce, marketing, and entertainment.Supports single-item try-ons (tops,bottoms, full-body outfits) and combination try-ons (top + bottom).","list":[{"title":"Virtual Try-On","media":{"referImageLeftTop":"https://p1-kling.klingai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/kling-homepage-aio-prod_aio/assets/images/tryon-1.3874def17be66c4e.png","referImageRight":"https://p1-kling.klingai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/kling-homepage-aio-prod_aio/assets/images/tryon-2.7cfafdf8c39f50df.png","type":"video","src":"https://v1-kling.kechuangai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/kling-homepage-aio-prod_aio/assets/videos/model-tryon-1.9399c8d0fb7a8791.mp4"}}]}]}},"ja":{"newInfo":{"marqueeLogos":{"row1":["https://p4-kling.klingai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/kling-web-tob/images/dev-home/logo/en/1-1.b4d04ac4a9ee8afd.png","https://p2-kling.klingai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/kling-web-tob/images/dev-home/logo/en/1-2.b005b1baf2b1862c.png","https://p2-kling.klingai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/kling-web-tob/images/dev-home/logo/en/1-3.69cefabb026085e5.png","https://p4-kling.klingai.com/kc